    "Description": "The librsvg2 packages provide a Scalable Vector Graphics (SVG) library based on the libart library.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* librsvg: Use-after-free when XML includes have duplicated entities (CVE-2026-96889,RUSTSEC-2026-0305)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
